  "raw_label": "appellant_lost",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "S.Kulandaivel vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety And Drug ... on 1 August, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.220 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 01.08.2024 Coram: The Honourable Mr. Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.22097 of 2024 and WMP.Nos.24089 & 24090 of 2024 S.Kulandaivel ... P Vs The Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, O/o. the Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, Dms Campus, Annasalai, Chennai 600 006 ..... Respondent Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution praying for the issuance of a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus calli the records pertaining to the impugned order of transfer in R.No.39 2024/S12/FSD, dated 19.07.2024 on the file of the respondent and qu the same as illegal and consequently to direct the respondent to fr general transfer guidelines and then conduct the transfer counselin necessary for transfers among the Food Safety Officers in Tamilnadu within the time stipulated by this Court. For Petitioner : Mr.S.Louis For Respondent : Mrs.M.Sneha, Special Counsel for Health D 1/6 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No.2 ORDER This writ petition is filed challenging the order of transfer dated 19.07.2024 on the file of the respondent thereby transferred the petitioner from Erode District to Krishnagiri District. S.Kulandaivel vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety And Drug ... on 1 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/199535326/ 1 2.",
    "facts": "Now after period of nearly three years, the petitioner has been transferred from Erode District to Krishnagiri District.",
    "arguments": "The respondent failed to frame any Rules so far for the Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department. Without even conducting any counselling, mechanically the petitioner has been transferred to other District."
  },
